tton><button class=\"flex items-center cursor-pointer p-2 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity text-gray-600\" aria-label=\"Search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></button><button class=\"lg:hidden p-1.5 text-gray-900\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 18h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><div class=\"h-14 shrink-0\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 justify-center relative\"><div class=\"flex w-full max-w-[1440px]\"><aside class=\"w-[330px] hidden lg:flex flex-col border-r border-gray-100 sticky top-[50px] h-[calc(100vh-50px)] shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-white\"><div class=\"flex-1 px-8 lg:px-10 py-12 overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center justify-between mb-8\"><span class=\"font-bold tracking-tighter text-[#8A0000]\">MENU</span><button class=\"p-1 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"lg:hidden mb-8 border-b border-gray-100 pb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#8A0000] mb-3\">Navigate</h3><nav class=\"space-y-0\"><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Education</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Research</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Innovation</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Admissions + Aid</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Campus Life</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Colleges</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">About Artemis</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Blog</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Artemis 2100</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Artemis Project</button><button class=\"block w-full text-left text-[15px] font-bold text-[#141414] py-2.5 hover:text-[#8A0000] hover:pl-1 transition-all\">Stanford 2025 (T1)</button></nav><div class=\"flex gap-3 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100\"><button class=\"flex-1 py-2.5 border border-[#8A0000] text-[#8A0000] text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-[#8A0000] hover:text-white transition-colors text-center\">Give</button><button class=\"flex-1 py-2.5 bg-[#8A0000] text-white text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-[#6B0000] transition-colors text-center\">Apply</button></div></div><div class=\"mb-10\"><h3 class=\"text-[14px] font-bold mb-4\">Explore websites, people, and locations</h3><button class=\"w-full bg-[#F3F3F3] p-3 flex items-center focus-within:bg-white focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-[#8A0000] transition-all text-left group\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search text-[#8A0000] mr-3 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors\">What are you looking for?</span><kbd class=\"ml-auto text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 bg-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded hidden sm:inline-block\">⌘K</kbd></button></div><div class=\"mb-10\"><h3 class=\"text-[14px] font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight\">Top resources for</h3><ul class=\"text-[14px] space-y-3 font-medium\"><li><button class=\"side-link w-full text-left\">Prospective Students</button></li><li><button class=\"side-link w-full text-left\">Current Students</button></li><li><button class=\"side-link w-full text-left\">Faculty &amp; Staff</button></li><li><button class=\"side-link w-full text-left\">Alumni</button></li><li><button class=\"side-link w-full text-left\">Communities &amp; Partners</button></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] p-5 mb-6 group\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-[3px]\"><div class=\"w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#8A0000]\"></div><div class=\"w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#8A0000]/70\"></div><div class=\"w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#8A0000]/70\"></div><div class=\"w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#8A0000]\"></div></div><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/90\">Artemis Project</span></div><p class=\"text-[13px] text-white/50 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Live seminars, real-time polls, breakout discussions, and AI-powered tutoring.</p><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 h-9 px-5 rounded bg-[#8A0000] text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-[#9B0F0F] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#8A0000]/20\">Enter the Forum<svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-[#FFF5F5] border border-[#FFDADA] p-5 mb-10\"><h4 class=\"text-[14px] font-bold border-b border-[#FFDADA] pb-2 mb-3\">Artemis Manifesto</h4><button class=\"text-[13px] leading-snug text-left hover:underline\">Read the &#x27;The Artemis Project&#x27; - our mission to re-engineer human learning.</button></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><button class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full py-3 border-t border-b border-gray-100 group\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] mb-1\">From the Blog</div><span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium group-hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors\">Latest stories &amp; research</span></div><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"pb-10 border-t border-gray-100 pt-8 px-8 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-1\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 3L4 9V19.5C4 28.5 11 35.5 20 37.5C29 35.5 36 28.5 36 19.5V9L20 3Z\" stroke=\"#8A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M20 5.5L6.5 10.8V19.5C6.5 27.2 12.4 33.2 20 35C27.6 33.2 33.5 27.2 33.5 19.5V10.8L20 5.5Z\" fill=\"rgba(138,0,0,0.06)\"></path><path d=\"M20 11L14 24H16.5L17.8 20.8H22.2L23.5 24H26L20 11ZM18.6 18.8L20 14.8L21.4 18.8H18.6Z\" fill=\"#8A0000\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"rgba(138,0,0,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"30.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"rgba(138,0,0,0.4)\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"30.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"rgba(138,0,0,0.4)\"></circle><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"30.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"rgba(138,0,0,0.4)\"></circle></svg><div class=\"leading-[1.1]\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-800\">University of </span><span class=\"text-[12px] font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-800\">Artemis</span></div></div><p class=\"text-[12px] text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-tight\">A global collegiate model for the collective future of humanity.</p><div class=\"text-[12px] space-x-2 mb-2 font-medium\"><button class=\"footer-link\">Visit</button><button class=\"footer-link\">Map</button><button class=\"footer-link\">Blog</button><button class=\"footer-link\">Events</button><button class=\"footer-link\">Careers</button><button class=\"footer-link text-[#8A0000]\">Give</button><button class=\"footer-link\">Contact</button></div><div class=\"text-[12px] space-x-2 mb-2 font-medium\"><button class=\"footer-link\">Privacy</button><button class=\"footer-link\">Accessibility</button></div><div class=\"text-[11px] space-x-2 mb-6 font-medium opacity-40\"><button class=\"footer-link\">Admin</button></div><div class=\"flex space-x-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-400\"><a href=\"https://x.com/artemisuni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors\">X</a><a href=\"https://facebook.com/artemisuni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors\">Facebook</a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com/school/artemisuni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"https://instagram.com/artemisuni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors\">Instagram</a></div></div></aside><main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-100 translate-y-0\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col bg-white overflow-y-auto\"><style>\n        .artemis-section {\n          transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;\n        }\n        .artemis-section[data-visible=\"false\"] {\n          opacity: 0;\n          transform: translateY(2rem);\n        }\n        .artemis-section[data-visible=\"true\"] {\n          opacity: 1;\n          transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n      </style><section class=\"relative w-full h-[55vh] sm:h-[65vh] min-h-[400px] sm:min-h-[480px] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762766910426-6452a4c75734?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=2400\" alt=\"Artemis Expedition\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-black/20\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/50 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-end h-full max-w-[1000px] mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-16 pb-10 sm:pb-16\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center space-x-3\"><span class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#8A0000]\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8A0000]\">The Artemis Project</span></div><h1 class=\"text-[36px] sm:text-[44px] md:text-[56px] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tighter text-white mb-6\">A new kind of university —<br/>one degree, every horizon.</h1><p class=\"text-[15px] sm:text-[18px] text-white/70 max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-light mb-8\">Founded to make rigorous, world-class education more accessible, recognizable, and transferable, the University of Artemis pioneers a global collegiate model — uniting 50 colleges across 35 countries under one accredited institution and one degree.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-5 text-[11px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-widest\"><span>Apr 25, 2026</span><button class=\"text-white border-b border-white hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity\">FULL STORY</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3\"><span class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#8A0000]\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8A0000]\">From the Journal</span></div><button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] border-b border-[#8A0000] hover:text-black hover:border-black transition-colors\">All Stories</button></div><div class=\"group cursor-pointer mb-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/10] bg-gray-100 overflow-hidden shadow-sm\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613592237001-84fb727ce569?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=800\" alt=\"Announcing the Founding Campaign: A Billion-Dollar Vision for the Future of Learning\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-[#8A0000] text-white px-2 py-0.5\">Campaign</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400\">May 12, 2026</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400\">| <!-- -->8 min read</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-extrabold mb-3 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] text-gray-900 leading-tight transition-colors\">Announcing the Founding Campaign: A Billion-Dollar Vision for the Future of Learning</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">The University of Artemis has officially launched its founding campaign, seeking to raise one billion dollars to endow the first truly global university. With pledges already exceeding three hundred million from founding partners across four continents, the campaign represents the largest philanthropic effort in higher education since the establishment of the Gates Millennium Scholars Program. Every dollar funds a seat at a table where disciplines converge and horizons expand.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-14 gap-y-12\"><article class=\"cursor-pointer group\"><div class=\"w-full mb-5 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 shadow-sm aspect-[16/10]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579165466949-3180a3d056d5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=800\" alt=\"The Synthetic Humanity Project: When Machines Learn to Think With Us\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\"/></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-900 text-white\">Research</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400\">May 5, 2026</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400\">| <!-- -->10 min read</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] text-gray-900 leading-tight transition-colors\">The Synthetic Humanity Project: When Machines Learn to Think With Us</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-[14px] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">A cross-center initiative spanning twelve faculty and four micro-colleges, the Synthetic Humanity Project is exploring what happens when artificial intelligence becomes a genuine cognitive partner rather than a mere tool. Early findings suggest that symbiotic human-AI reasoning can double creative output while preserving moral agency — a result that challenges the prevailing narrative of automation as displacement.</p></article><article class=\"cursor-pointer group\"><div class=\"w-full mb-5 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 shadow-sm aspect-[16/10]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579165466949-3180a3d056d5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=800\" alt=\"Bio-Regenerative Systems: Growing the Infrastructure of Tomorrow\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\"/></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-900 text-white\">Research</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400\">Apr 28, 2026</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400\">| <!-- -->9 min read</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] text-gray-900 leading-tight transition-colors\">Bio-Regenerative Systems: Growing the Infrastructure of Tomorrow</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-[14px] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">Researchers at the Center for Bio-Regenerative Arts have achieved a breakthrough in self-healing building materials, demonstrating concrete-like composites that repair micro-fractures using embedded bacterial colonies. The technology, originally developed for deep-sea habitats, is now being adapted for earthquake-prone urban zones — bringing science fiction construction methods into real-world application within the decade.</p></article></div></div></div></section><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto w-full px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center mb-0\"><div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-gray-200\"></div><span class=\"mx-4 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500\">Global Learning Interface</span><div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-gray-200\"></div></div></div><section class=\"py-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mb-16\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center space-x-3\"><span class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#8A0000]\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8A0000]\">Consortium Infrastructure</span></div><h2 class=\"text-[34px] sm:text-[42px] md:text-[54px] font-bold text-[#141414] leading-[1] mb-12 tracking-tighter\">A federated alliance of autonomous colleges co-creating<!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#8A0000]\">shared academic scaffolds.</span></h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start\"><p class=\"text-[20px] text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">The Artemis Collegium Network (ACN) operates as a distributed guild system. Instead of isolated campuses, we maintain a network of co-branded nodes where faculty, students, and research are perfectly synchronized across physical and virtual domains.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 pt-2\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none mb-3 tabular-nums\">20</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] leading-tight\">Founding<br/>Micro-Colleges</div><div class=\"absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-100\"></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none mb-3 tabular-nums\">ECTS</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] leading-tight\">Unified<br/>Credit Mapping</div><div class=\"absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-100\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gray-50 py-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center space-x-3\"><span class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#8A0000]\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8A0000]\">By the Numbers</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-200\"></div><div class=\"text-[32px] sm:text-[42px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none mb-3 tabular-nums\">20</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] leading-tight mb-1\">Founding Micro-Colleges</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Active nodes worldwide</div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-200\"></div><div class=\"text-[32px] sm:text-[42px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none mb-3 tabular-nums\">ECTS</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] leading-tight mb-1\">Unified Credit Mapping</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Fully transferable across nodes</div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-200\"></div><div class=\"text-[32px] sm:text-[42px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none mb-3 tabular-nums\">6</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] leading-tight mb-1\">Continents</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Spanning every time zone</div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-200\"></div><div class=\"text-[32px] sm:text-[42px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none mb-3 tabular-nums\">1</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] leading-tight mb-1\">Accredited Degree</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Recognised globally</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><div class=\"relative w-full min-h-[380px] md:min-h-[460px] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1624555130296-e551faf8969b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1400\" alt=\"Artemis Global Campus\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/80 via-black/50 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-end h-full min-h-[380px] md:min-h-[460px] p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-14\"><div class=\"bg-white max-w-sm p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-xl\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#8A0000] tracking-widest mb-3 uppercase\">Global Network</div><h3 class=\"text-[24px] font-bold text-[#141414] mb-3 leading-tight\">One university, every horizon</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5\">The Artemis Collegium Network spans six continents, synchronizing faculty, students, and research across physical and virtual domains — a single accredited institution with the reach of a constellation.</p><button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border-b-2 border-[#8A0000] text-[#8A0000] pb-1 hover:text-black hover:border-black transition-colors\">Explore the Network →</button></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pb-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><section class=\"py-20 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto w-full\"><div class=\"mb-12 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center space-x-3\"><span class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#8A0000]\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8A0000]\">Global Network</span></div><h2 class=\"text-[36px] md:text-[42px] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tighter text-[#141414] mb-4 uppercase\">Global Presence</h2><p class=\"text-gray-500 max-w-lg text-[16px] leading-relaxed font-light\">Founding nodes of the Artemis Collegium Network</p></div><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-white\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677376e1e97650585235ab96/677e1de06571eae8d537fc47_map.avif\" alt=\"World Map\" class=\"w-full h-auto pointer-events-none select-none opacity-80\"/><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:52%;top:39%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View VALLETTA\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  left-full ml-2 md:ml-3\">VALLETTA</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:56%;top:56%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View KIGALI\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  left-full ml-2 md:ml-3\">KIGALI</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:51%;top:30%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View BERLIN\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  left-full ml-2 md:ml-3\">BERLIN</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:15%;top:37%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View SAN FRANCISCO\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  left-full ml-2 md:ml-3\">SAN FRANCISCO</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:85%;top:37%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View TOKYO\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  right-full mr-2 md:mr-3\">TOKYO</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:42%;top:18%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View REYKJAVIK\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  left-full ml-2 md:ml-3\">REYKJAVIK</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:77%;top:55%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View SINGAPORE\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  right-full mr-2 md:mr-3\">SINGAPORE</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex items-center justify-center z-10\" style=\"left:31%;top:66%\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0)\"><button class=\"relative w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#8A0000] hover:bg-red-800 rounded-full shrink-0 cursor-pointer transition-colors border-[3px] border-transparent hover:border-black\" aria-label=\"View SÃO PAULO\"></button><div class=\"absolute bg-black text-white font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.15em] px-3 py-1.5 whitespace-nowrap top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none shadow-sm\n                  left-full ml-2 md:ml-3\">SÃO PAULO</div></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gray-50 py-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 artemis-section\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl space-y-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div class=\"group\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#8A0000] tracking-widest mb-4\">01 — CONTRIBUTION</div><h4 class=\"text-[18px] font-bold text-[#141414] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide\">Node Contribution Model</h4><p class=\"text-[15px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Member colleges contribute faculty and student cohorts to the collective pool, ensuring localized curriculum grounded in global standards.</p></div><div class=\"group\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#8A0000] tracking-widest mb-4\">02 — INFRASTRUCTURE</div><h4 class=\"text-[18px] font-bold text-[#141414] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide\">Infrastructure Shield</h4><p class=\"text-[15px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Artemis provides a unified <strong>Guild system</strong>, student funding, and the<!-- --> <strong>Artemis Commons</strong> for global research publishing.</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-8\"><button class=\"flex items-center space-x-6 py-3 border-b-2 border-[#8A0000] text-[#8A0000] text-[14px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-black hover:border-black transition-all group\"><span>Build with the Alliance</span><svg class=\"group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"max-w-[1000px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center mb-16\"><div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-gray-200\"></div><span class=\"mx-4 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500\">Upcoming Events</span><div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-gray-200\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center space-x-3\"><span class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#8A0000]\"></span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8A0000]\">Calendar</span></div><h2 class=\"text-[30px] sm:text-[36px] md:text-[42px] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tighter text-[#141414] mb-6\">What&#x27;s happening<br/>at Artemis</h2><p class=\"text-[16px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8\">From public lectures and research symposia to cultural festivals and open days, the Artemis network is always alive with events that bring our global community together.</p><button class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 py-3 border-b-2 border-[#8A0000] text-[#8A0000] text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-black hover:border-black transition-all group\"><span>Full Events Calendar</span><svg class=\"group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-0\"><button class=\"group w-full flex items-start gap-6 py-5 border-b border-gray-200 hover:border-[#8A0000] transition-colors text-left\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-[60px] text-center pt-1\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] mb-1\">Sun</div><div class=\"text-[22px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none tabular-nums\">18</div><div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase\">May</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000]\">Open Day</span></div><h4 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[#141414] group-hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors leading-tight mb-1\">Open Day: Malta Central Node</h4><p class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Tour the Valletta campus, meet faculty from all seven schools, and experience a live co-design session with current students.</p></div><svg class=\"shrink-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all mt-3\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button><button class=\"group w-full flex items-start gap-6 py-5 border-b border-gray-200 hover:border-[#8A0000] transition-colors text-left\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-[60px] text-center pt-1\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] mb-1\">Sun</div><div class=\"text-[22px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none tabular-nums\">25</div><div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase\">May</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000]\">Symposium</span></div><h4 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[#141414] group-hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors leading-tight mb-1\">The Synthetic Humanity Symposium</h4><p class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Leading researchers from the Center for Synthetic Intelligence present findings from the first year of the Symbiotic Cognition Initiative.</p></div><svg class=\"shrink-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all mt-3\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button><button class=\"group w-full flex items-start gap-6 py-5 border-b border-gray-200 hover:border-[#8A0000] transition-colors text-left\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-[60px] text-center pt-1\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] mb-1\">Mon</div><div class=\"text-[22px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none tabular-nums\">2</div><div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase\">Jun</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000]\">Competition</span></div><h4 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[#141414] group-hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors leading-tight mb-1\">Artemis Global Hackathon</h4><p class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">A 72-hour cross-node challenge where students from all 20 micro-colleges collaborate to prototype solutions to real-world problems.</p></div><svg class=\"shrink-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all mt-3\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button><button class=\"group w-full flex items-start gap-6 py-5 border-b border-gray-200 hover:border-[#8A0000] transition-colors text-left\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-[60px] text-center pt-1\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] mb-1\">Sat</div><div class=\"text-[22px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none tabular-nums\">14</div><div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase\">Jun</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000]\">Exhibition</span></div><h4 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[#141414] group-hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors leading-tight mb-1\">Bio-Regenerative Arts Exhibition</h4><p class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">An immersive showcase of living tissue sculptures, self-healing architecture models, and bio-engineered materials from our Berlin hub.</p></div><svg class=\"shrink-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all mt-3\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button><button class=\"group w-full flex items-start gap-6 py-5 border-b border-gray-200 hover:border-[#8A0000] transition-colors text-left\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-[60px] text-center pt-1\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000] mb-1\">Sat</div><div class=\"text-[22px] font-black text-[#141414] leading-none tabular-nums\">28</div><div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase\">Jun</div></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A0000]\">Ceremony</span></div><h4 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[#141414] group-hover:text-[#8A0000] transition-colors leading-tight mb-1\">Commencement Ceremony 2026</h4><p class=\"text-[13px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">The Artemis Class of 2026 presents their capstone contributions and receives degrees at the annual global commencement, streamed live from Malta.</p></div><svg class=\"shrink-0 w-4 h-4 text-gray-300 group-hover:text-[#8A0000] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all mt-3\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></button></div></div></div></section><div class=\"bg-[#8A0000] text-white p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center\"><div class=\"mb-6 md:mb-0 max-w-lg text-center md:text-left\"><h4 class=\"text-[20px] font-bold mb-2\">Want more about the Artemis Project?</h4><p class=\"text-[16px] font-medium leading-relaxed\">Explore<!-- --> <button class=\"underline hover:opacity-80\">the Artemis Journal</button>, or subscribe to receive<!-- --> <button class=\"underline hover:opacity-80\">weekly dispatches</button> <!-- -->in your inbox.</p></div><form class=\"flex gap-2 \"><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" class=\"flex-1 border border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-gray-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#8A0000]/30 focus:border-[#8A0000] transition-all\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-[#8A0000] text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#6B0000] transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed shrink-0\">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></div></main></div></div><div class=\"fixed bottom-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white text-[13px] text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg><span>Ask a question</span></button></div><nav class=\"fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-white border-t border-gray-200 lg:hidden safe-area-bottom\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-around h-14\"><button class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 flex-1 h-full transition-colors text-[#8A0000]\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-wid